{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27255","headline":"贻美人 · 章孝标","name":"贻美人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诸侯帐下惯新妆，皆怯刘家薄媚娘。\n宝髻巧梳金翡翠，罗裙宜着绣鸳鸯。\n轻轻舞汗初沾袖，细细歌声欲遶梁。\n何事不归巫峡去，故来人世断人肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}